@startuml state_diagram
' Coaching session lifecycle

hide empty description

[*] --> Requested
Requested --> Retrieving : start
Retrieving --> Generating : chunks ready
Generating --> Verifying : draft ready
Verifying --> Answered : grounded
Verifying --> Refused : ungrounded
Answered --> [*]
Refused --> [*]

note right of Refused
  Low-relevance retrieval or
  ungrounded claim -> refuse,
  offer safe generic guidance
end note
@enduml